  "releaseNotes": "Composite-cell shapes (Change<V>, Fraction, Share, Percent, Segments) with [MarkoutDelta]/[MarkoutUnit] render as a dense Markdown table and decompose into typed JSONL/TSV columns. JSONL supports heterogeneous records (MarkoutWriterOptions.OmitEmptyJsonFields) and numeric/boolean values (MarkoutWriterOptions.JsonTypedValues). BREAKING (since 0.16.0): the Breakdown element type Segment(Category, Count) is renamed to Slice(Category, Count) and Breakdown.Segments to Breakdown.Slices; update `new Segment(...)` to `new Slice(...)`.",
